  "priorExpiration": "1997-06-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 103.02 Officers.\n\n(a) The board shall elect a president for a one-year term commencing in March. The president shall chair the board's meetings and establish the order of its business, consistent with the formal actions of the board.\n\n(b) The board shall elect a vice president for a one-year term commencing in March. The vice president shall perform the duties of the president in the absence of the president.\n\nSource. #5024, eff 12-4-90; ss by #6450, INTERIM, eff 2-8-97, EXPIRES: 6-8-97; ss by #6480, eff 3-29-97; ss by #7417, eff 12-21-00; ss by #9386, eff 2-11-09; ss by #13269, eff 9-29-21; ss by #14627, eff 7-1-26",
